        },
        {
          "text": " Konye ŋes elopet kolot alosit naka adiopepaaran amodiŋ, kobu, kiboikin otolim loka erotem: kilipakin bon atwanare; kobala ebe, “Edolit; wu EJAKAIT, kolema akaiiar; naarai mam eoŋ ajokuna adepar lukapapaaka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
