        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema atiar, “Kerumit noi ekokote kanuka EJAKAIT, Edeke loka ajoresio; naarai ajalata idwe luka Isirael aitutuketekon, atiyaikis itemwanakon, aarata inabinokon kekiletj: eoŋ, eoŋ bon asal; emoete da akaijar amudiar.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
