        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema atiar, “Kolom, kobwo komoru loka EJAKAIT.” Ido koany, kotubor EJAKAIT, kodi ekwam loepol loegogon ironan, kobwanabwan atiiban kakonyen nuka EJAKAIT: konye komamei EJAKAIT kokwam: akaulo kekwam amaran naka akwap; konye kotnamei EJAKAIT kamaran naka akwap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
