        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi, kiira Eliya, kimuko akekou kegoeke, koloma, kobwo neelomarere abua, Ido koany, kobu eporoto mama ejai ŋesi ebe, “Eliya, inyo bo iswamai ijo kane?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
