        },
        {
          "text": "Kinyek imoŋin, koker atupit Eliya, kotema atiar, “Keŋaiŋait, kisiikinai kanu papaka ka totoka, kasodi konyet eoŋ atupun jo.” Kotema ŋes atiar, “Koboŋo; naarai inyo bo keswamak eoŋ jo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.20",
